WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
When you look, it piles up tightly, tightly, forming a great ring.

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.320
The people around them must face the deadly cold wind.

3
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:08.119
The people inside can keep warm with body heat.

4
00:00:08.119 --> 00:00:10.440
However, the people within the circle must constantly change.

5
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.360
Slowly position the people on the outer perimeter to the center of the circle.

6
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.840
If someone remains on the perimeter for a long time

7
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.160
I'll freeze to death

8
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.840
The people inside will be exposed to the cold wind.

9
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:20.560
Now

10
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.160
For penguins, the fat and downy feathers around their mouths help retain warmth.

11
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.080
However, the human body has no mechanism to protect against such cold.

12
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.840
Therefore, everyone must constantly stretch out one leg and squeeze their calf.

13
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.120
In this way, miserably exhausting oneself.

14
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.680
According to a news report, everyone will freeze to death within a few hours.

